  "worked_solution": "To find the complex conjugate, we flip the sign of the imaginary part.\n\nIn the given number $z=-1+10i,$ the imaginary part is $10i.$ Flipping the sign, we get $-10i.$\n\nTherefore, the complex conjugate is given by $\\overset{\u2015}{z}=-1-10i.$",
